      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "北京解放十年了。",
      "output_sha256": "afd73755b01b888de4b9de78ac913adc8fb167d7da59430d3b60b7705b5453f8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "afd73755b01b888de4b9de78ac913adc8fb167d7da59430d3b60b7705b5453f8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "十年间的变化实在无法片语道尽。",
      "output_sha256": "28449255efa05209b3374f3f48025ff5027bb283329965eeb3a11bfd7a39dbbd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "28449255efa05209b3374f3f48025ff5027bb283329965eeb3a11bfd7a39dbbd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "所以我只想在这里说一件事。",
      "output_sha256": "bb6cd5722c7331e42a6c85ce9a97c614c52d30e981274e13fab8bd5da6bf9816",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "bb6cd5722c7331e42a6c85ce9a97c614c52d30e981274e13fab8bd5da6bf9816",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我要说说北京多么干净。",
      "output_sha256": "50c4a48ed334daae3cd9d4404707f55579e4e05d957ff74c5f0403e1dccc522f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "50c4a48ed334daae3cd9d4404707f55579e4e05d957ff74c5f0403e1dccc522f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "是啊，北京的清洁卫生工作的确作的好，年年有进步，这是值得骄傲的。",
      "output_sha256": "ae055d3398fba6dc0d6e3323c8e589f82678054f2a62704bcbd8764db9a77fde",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "ae055d3398fba6dc0d6e3323c8e589f82678054f2a62704bcbd8764db9a77fde",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不过，我要说的不是街道与庭院的干净，而是我们的生活如何干净。",
      "output_sha256": "1beb66f444ff549000770d67afd639980ee14874ace00a0f4c3538ef4fcda765",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "1beb66f444ff549000770d67afd639980ee14874ace00a0f4c3538ef4fcda765",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这是更值得我们骄傲的事。",
      "output_sha256": "42205ebf7ac1967a5b81fa545947a8b8041704b204a33951a41cfe5934c6902d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "42205ebf7ac1967a5b81fa545947a8b8041704b204a33951a41cfe5934c6902d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "将北京与纽约、伦敦、巴黎等西方大城市做个比较，便能领悟到北京的卓越。",
      "output_sha256": "8c1b6dbbcc0658b49caafef7e3d5e300aff29c6c6b7bf86b6914ed316600efed",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.477447,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "be45b07389986b34caa884271bf35d05d5fada61c08ae2c402034613f2f88e64"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8c1b6dbbcc0658b49caafef7e3d5e300aff29c6c6b7bf86b6914ed316600efed",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在那些大都市里，什么样的荒谬与荒淫的事情都有，而北京呢，解放前有过的坏事都一一地消灭，到今天它已成为最干净的城市。",
      "output_sha256": "34a4c4988b320ad966b1dcf284f4cf40d6329e5c3e6c601e86b2cbfd5b28adf0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "34a4c4988b320ad966b1dcf284f4cf40d6329e5c3e6c601e86b2cbfd5b28adf0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "大家都知道，解放不久后，党和政府便帮助那些不幸的姐妹们走出困境。",
      "output_sha256": "97372c35bbd414b95dc0ac11e79514a0f2f544afd212c74e3779aa184aaf9cd4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.633113,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c0a103a90f4374714a010bf1320f8857038cb8253a5851513b8c59fcb7db8166"
