      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1820e943063a01f593f19175885d8f073121d35e9a86868b5b12fc17e9ea8773",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们的社会制度使得女性真正享有了平等、自由与幸福。",
