      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "那些西方国家总是强调“民主”和“人道主义”，可看看他们的“民主”和“人道主义”吧！",
      "output_sha256": "db41425d6605e1ea4e0df49d2bf73eac88af702ef2fc7955534725d1a5c25d13",
