      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在那些西方的大都市里，荒淫无耻的事情还不止表现在玩弄妓女上。",
      "output_sha256": "3099378cb14fae5c9355d45b849e8cfb490df2e658aa8ca5e56dc1b731d84419",
