      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7ef0a10190e342aaf9a5a806a014956ee087ee3125322d28b545438c0c8c9a29",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们每天高高兴兴地投入工作。",
      "output_sha256": "6e3976b450088a4733dc495c4f5c08e5b25b97ec970714bc89d7962fa0e78a92",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.686538,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6de1e3a23158d0a669171d72967c69f598b6ec299d1e203fdfcdc18baa24f41a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6e3976b450088a4733dc495c4f5c08e5b25b97ec970714bc89d7962fa0e78a92",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "干活儿的目的既不为个人发财，也不是为替别人致富，而是为了那个共同的、崇高的目的，多快好省地建设社会主义。",
      "output_sha256": "9ff5977a058b3f7e86e478777689230333f8224c5788ae0bebbe0ee6925a7cd2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "9ff5977a058b3f7e86e478777689230333f8224c5788ae0bebbe0ee6925a7cd2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这一目标是公共的，而非私人的；它既不狭隘，也不见不得人，反而是崇高而光明的。",
      "output_sha256": "dc966e4ee6735b9c2932782f46cf3fa20fe513cb092896560990ff57a7912460",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.450137,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3879bd48140e47e65eb163fcab064d32f328333c4253156f4d0f9678fffceb23"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dc966e4ee6735b9c2932782f46cf3fa20fe513cb092896560990ff57a7912460",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "因为有这个目的在心，所以人人的脸上才都有一种尊傲的神气，知道自己的工作的重要，必须下决心去作好。",
      "output_sha256": "8aa7621f07dede24f3aa314fcce224ff4490da54d2bffc6484ca9eff753d93ed",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "8aa7621f07dede24f3aa314fcce224ff4490da54d2bffc6484ca9eff753d93ed",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "真的，在我们的社会制度下，事事都在光天化日之下摆出来，没有偷偷地藏在抽屉里的。",
      "output_sha256": "3f6fec51384deb39186052479d534d95cc5f5bf5cc5aaa6d12c677d46640cecb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "3f6fec51384deb39186052479d534d95cc5f5bf5cc5aaa6d12c677d46640cecb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们的共同理想激励着每一个人奋发向上，展现出英雄气概。",
      "output_sha256": "4fa781c6ee6303dec5f0896ab115a95d85d47f749712e618e327b9f33fe2df5d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.684955,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d571c5107f5ea9d13cfc6398746e18f498bee872f85d7bae3e35188fe8b9c9f5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4fa781c6ee6303dec5f0896ab115a95d85d47f749712e618e327b9f33fe2df5d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们既不为三个钱的油，两个钱的醋去吵嘴打架，也决不想去占别人的小便宜，更甭说去剥削别人或玩弄妇女了。",
      "output_sha256": "db4bcd9b1b61ddf36cbb448c7c69cd1e1e5766c1452272cb705eb8febabfa3f3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "db4bcd9b1b61ddf36cbb448c7c69cd1e1e5766c1452272cb705eb8febabfa3f3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们是生了双翅，往高处飞的人民，决不甘于在泥塘里滚来滚去！",
      "output_sha256": "fa7e527137e83e557cc2c104865af2d551843a8790768ac864b714da4f4205f8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "fa7e527137e83e557cc2c104865af2d551843a8790768ac864b714da4f4205f8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "是的，我们鄙弃什么阿飞舞，与好莱坞的荒唐的电影等等。",
      "output_sha256": "6e64926208db5eaad4f07f9b6cf899dfd61e2c6bfcd93d21ee0ff2d5c7cea576",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "6e64926208db5eaad4f07f9b6cf899dfd61e2c6bfcd93d21ee0ff2d5c7cea576",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们的崇高理想不允许我们沉迷于伤风败俗的消遣。",
      "output_sha256": "090b8fd9a091d798c256f845f82d8ff9cae883afa969dbc00aff7deb14daef8b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.801084,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2a60acea70a955fa543c326b1ef4636313ee753199c135e105e4ec4efda1e639"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "090b8fd9a091d798c256f845f82d8ff9cae883afa969dbc00aff7deb14daef8b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "连低级的黄色歌曲我们都觉得可耻。",
      "output_sha256": "aa4ea301e0d74ed4a03dde14e646fadbd35740e4599772f6d81970e873c455ee",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.523019,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5ac26981c468a6faa3d0311a810a6dd217d9b332af9715061f5e823a15a73843"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "aa4ea301e0d74ed4a03dde14e646fadbd35740e4599772f6d81970e873c455ee",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "反之，我们都愿意提高自己的文化水平，在业余时间，我们念书、画画，练习作诗，学习歌舞。",
      "output_sha256": "932ac31f4f7c6b7af6d5bb9ca9d865575476c13da06f634703187d3f65149599",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "932ac31f4f7c6b7af6d5bb9ca9d865575476c13da06f634703187d3f65149599",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "劳动完了就睡大觉，不是我们的理想。",
      "output_sha256": "7f83f23c96d15ac7e3b02e9bfb742a88228c74a607bb89dea2f99d37bc992b3b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "7f83f23c96d15ac7e3b02e9bfb742a88228c74a607bb89dea2f99d37bc992b3b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们要尽力于技术革命，以期逐渐减轻体力上的负担，缩短操作时间。",
      "output_sha256": "550e41ffa3c73291b8ba24ef9ab1acdc3edcc5a23728c9999d8f20644c6ecf05",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
