      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "到该睡觉的时候就去睡无忧无虑的甜觉。",
      "output_sha256": "fd2427fd4d728d716221ef2d1faa7f86763082b1fb651b4561f738b5ba364434",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "fd2427fd4d728d716221ef2d1faa7f86763082b1fb651b4561f738b5ba364434",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是，在劳动与睡眠之间，我们要求生活丰富，你打球，我种花，他学习哲学或科学。",
      "output_sha256": "11fdb790944825d6e6afd08c6bbfd9a630ff4be7c7bb7f2472728c2558721790",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "11fdb790944825d6e6afd08c6bbfd9a630ff4be7c7bb7f2472728c2558721790",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们的生活既要像水晶那么透明，又要像玛瑙那么美丽多彩。",
      "output_sha256": "c576601857cec629419e372849b2d3fadaba0114628e2c4d667f8b599f34c5bc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "c576601857cec629419e372849b2d3fadaba0114628e2c4d667f8b599f34c5bc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "十年来，北京人民的生活不正是一年比一年更加美好吗？",
      "output_sha256": "6e378c592311e5e7a39e99b71eafc89ef29e3476a3ac96799f3a81a8e0bf2fac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.613341,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
