      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6e378c592311e5e7a39e99b71eafc89ef29e3476a3ac96799f3a81a8e0bf2fac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "二十多年前，我曾写了一些小说描绘北京劳动人民的艰辛，如《骆驼祥子》和《月牙儿》等。",
      "output_sha256": "fe9c01b346ac380ea5bbe57a47fc5046b97e731ae15b1381b86fc118f97a7dc3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.722353,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "af8ed49c3bf4f90eec5b5a848ff4f6ae201df403aab8c915565f441fb194b2e0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fe9c01b346ac380ea5bbe57a47fc5046b97e731ae15b1381b86fc118f97a7dc3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "今天还有那些事吗？",
      "output_sha256": "a694c17e5a07fe4259d10f33865063ff8d19cad2efef0d9c069d142f108694da",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "a694c17e5a07fe4259d10f33865063ff8d19cad2efef0d9c069d142f108694da",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如果今天的“祥子”还在干着他老本行，他也必定受到尊重，不再被人随意呼唤，像牲畜般对待。",
      "output_sha256": "af5ca0438f3b049530dce90fd5f8f581ecc432f68b9337c1f44237d3b3652b8f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.576689,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
