      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "21281cc98fcc2b3274f95f775f80673b838549fd1d10f858d077e4bfa4703311"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8bad3a19067628ffed468c20bd6bc71e743299e769745664185ab1ee5f23e176",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "西城区的妇女商店完全由女性经营，成为北京市财政贸易战线的一面旗帜！",
      "output_sha256": "902638613f4f189b8b115bd42a6f7195b4798191a31ba602580988f0972f0d11",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": 0.726545,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        61
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1b5bb1f707240b18e1998f1b4a90b8bba88aab3994d84cc348dfedd70ffd2831"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "902638613f4f189b8b115bd42a6f7195b4798191a31ba602580988f0972f0d11",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "谁还敢轻视女性，玩弄女服务员？",
      "output_sha256": "faee83c3027c4aa00732ea321db504ffffb92815b141e4e5a9fbdb45703a02da",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": 0.526749,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f8fbbe9c6fdd3022554eff5f602df492f95bbe594462860e118279d043c66d76"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "faee83c3027c4aa00732ea321db504ffffb92815b141e4e5a9fbdb45703a02da",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那些女店员们担当起一切原来由男人干的活儿。",
      "output_sha256": "30b29c62238ad3939505e37d9f2d07506bbbc70246eac0bea1858a83cb1366f2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 63,
